    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いらっしゃいませ、
食料品店「サーロイン」です
ご入用は何ですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hello and welcome. We're the
grocery goods store, "Sirloin."
What is it you're looking for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうも、
ありがとうございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you very, very much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は70年前、
バジリスク退治に出て
砂漠で石にされてしまいました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Seventy years ago, I went out
into the desert to kill basilisks,
but got turned to stone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>つい先ごろ、元に戻してもらい
世の中が変わっていて
びっくりです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I returned to normal just recently,
bot now the world around me is
so shockingly different.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この街だけは
70年前と変わりません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This town's about the only
place that hasn't changed.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おちつく～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I feel so at
ease here~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は70年の間
バジリスクに石にされ
砂漠の中に立っていました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>After being turned to stone
by a basilisk, I was left out
in the desert for 70 years.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その間の記憶は
まったくありません……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It was a long time, but I have
no memories of it at all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279200</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その間、流砂にもまれて
水に沈んで
見世物にされたみたいです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seems I sank into quicksand, then
into water, and then I was included
in an odd sideshow collection.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279200</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、全然覚えていないのです……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, I don't remember
even a single thing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は長い間、
バジリスクに石にされたのですが、
つくづく幸せだと思います</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>After a basilisk turned me to stone, I was
left that way for a long time, but really,
I think I was extremely lucky.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>中にはバジリスクの
鋭い牙で命を落としたものも
いたそうですから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, a lot of people
lost their lives to the
basilisks' sharp fangs...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ものは考えようです。
石にされたからと言って
嘆く必要もないのですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Life is what you make of it, really.
There's no sense in bemoaning mine
just because I was turned to stone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いえ、嘆く暇も
なかったのですが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, not that I really got a
chance to be upset over it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>砂漠にはたくさん
石像があるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There are a great many
stone statues in the desert.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279212</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれは昔
バジリスクに石にされた人なのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those are all people who
were long ago turned to
stone by the basilisks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279216</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>砂漠の石像を商売に使えないかと
思ったんだがなんか
やっぱ気持ち悪いな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I considered if I might be able to
sell those statues for a tidy profit,
but...it felt wrong, you know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279216</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんたって
もともと生身の人だし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They were all real, living
people once, after all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスクは少なくなったが
石化された人は今だ、
砂の中から発見される</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There aren't many basilisks left these
days, but the people they petrified are
often found within the sands even now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>砂の中から手がにょきっと
出てるの見た人間は皆
心臓が止まる想いだと言っているな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The people who find them always say
it felt like their heart stopped, seeing a
human hand jutting up from the sands...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>砂漠を歩けば必ず
石化している人間に会う
と言っても言いすぎではないな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's not exaggerating to say you're
guaranteed to find one or two, if
you wander the desert a while.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>砂漠で石にされた人が
何年も経ってから元に戻って
帰ってくるケースは稀だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There are cases where—after many, many
years in the desert—someone once turned
to stone returns to normal, but it's rare.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>多くは風にさらされ、
あるいは人に破壊され
ただの残骸になってしまうからだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Most of them are worn away by the wind,
or smashed up by humans, and end up as
nothing more than dead bodies, really.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最悪なのは体の一部だけが
壊れたりした人だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But the worst cases are the
ones where their bodies are
mostly intact, but for one part.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>時々、そういう石像を
見つけて気の毒に
思うのだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I find statues like that
once in a while, and I
always feel bad for them...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
