    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんにちは、
食材屋「サーロイン」へ
ようこそ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey there. Welcome to the
grocery store, "Sirloin."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何か買っていって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Buy something, won't you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279252</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おいしくいただいてくださいね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hope it's nice
and yummy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>このお店では
お酒も出しているの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We even sell
alcohol here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279260</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもぉ……
あなたたちは未成年だから
ダメよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Buuut... Aren't you
underaged? We can't
sell to you, sorry...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いらっしゃいませ～
……ってあら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hello and welcome~
...Oh, wait.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>子どもには
お酒はダ・メ∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You kids can't
buy alcohol! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279268</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>食材をサカナに
お酒を一杯いかが？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How about some fish,
with a glass of wine?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279268</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あなたたちは
ダメだからね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, but you kids
can't drink, though!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お酒を出し始めてから
なかなかお店が繁盛しちゃって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The shop's been doing
really well since we
started selling alcohol...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ジュースもあれば
よかったわね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe we should
sell soft drinks, too?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか変な娘が
私の仕事を横取りしようと
してるらしいの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I heard some weird
girl's trying to take
my job from me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279276</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、私は人気の看板娘だし
横取りなんてさせないけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, well, I'm super popular and
attract customers just by being
here. She doesn't stand a chance.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いらっしゃいませ～
いかがですか～？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hello and welcome~
What would you like~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうかしら？　私の方が
年季が入ってるのよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What do you think? My
experience kind of speaks
for itself, doesn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シグルドってヤツは
本当に残酷なヤツらだよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those Sigurd guys
are a damn cruel
buncha bastards!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>雨が降って
気に入らないからって、
街を襲うようなヤツらだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Say it starts raining, and that puts
'em in a foul mood? Then they'll
ransack a whole town, just like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>雨がイヤなら、
外に出てくるなよっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you don't like the rain,
then just stay inside, dammit!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>シグルドのヤツらが
ヴァルハラを占領して、
もうずいぶんになるな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those Sigurd bastards have
done some real terrible stuff
since they occupied Valhalla.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人質になっていた「紅の月」の
採掘団もブレイナーの命令で
皆殺しにされたらしいぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Those people mining "Crimson Moon," who
they'd taken hostage? Brynhildr gave an
order to kill every last one of 'em.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279292</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヴァルハラの街は
無事解放されたみたいだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Looks like they managed
to liberate Valhalla.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279292</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これでようやく
ヴァルハラも鉱石の街としての
顔を取り戻せるってわけだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now Valhalla can finally 
restore its good reputation
as a mining town.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヴァルハラは解放されたけど
まだ逃げた「シグルド」が
たくさんいるみたいだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Valhalla was liberated, but seems
like there's still a lot of "Sigurd"
types who managed to escape.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>徹底的に弾圧して、
根絶やしにしてほしいもんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here's hopin' they'll use some good
old fashioned *force* and root
the bastards out for good.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>聞いたかい？
この街にも「シグルド」の
生き残りが隠れてるって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have you heard? They're 
sayin' there's some "Sigurd"
remnants in this town, too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>コワいね、恐ろしいね！
早く捕まらないかね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Terrifying! Horrifying, even! We
need to catch 'em, and fast!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この街に「シグルド」の残党が
逃げ込んだって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Some of those "Sigurd" types
are hiding out in this very town!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どいつがそうなんだい！？
あんたらかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, who the hell are
they!? Is it you lot?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……疑心暗鬼になって
いかんよ、まったく</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Nah, I can't go jumping
at every shadow. Dammit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちーす！
食い物屋「サーロイン」ょぅ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wassup! This's "Sirloin."
We sell food 'n stuff.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何買ぃたぃ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whaddya wanna buy?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279312</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちーす
また来てーっす</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Laters. Come again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>63</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お腹へったので
買い物レス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sooo hungry.
I'mma buy a snack.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>美味しいものは
ないレショウカ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aren't there
any yum-yums?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ごはんは
命の洗濯なのレス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yummies wash away
life's stresses.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お腹が空いタラ
戦争はできナイ
って言うレショ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't they says
that armies march
on their tummies?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お母サンの
お手伝いなのレス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm helping
my mommy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>生クリーム、キャビア、
キャベツ、りんご……
お母サンは何を……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Fresh cream, caviar, cabbage, apples...
Um, what's mommy making...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お腹がへったのレス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm so hungry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>70</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっさと材料を買って
お家へ帰るレス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I just wanna buy groceries
real fast and go home.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>70</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今日はアッシが
夕飯の当番なのレス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm gonna make
dinner tonight.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>72</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何か美味しいモノが
食べたいのレス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wanna eat
something yummy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>72</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>マグロをアイスで包んだ
マグロアイスなんて
どうレショウカ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe I'll put tuna
in ice cream? Hmm,
tuna ice cream...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>72</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279340</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ステキなお料理ができタラ、
お兄チャンたちにも
食べさせてあげるのレス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once I make something really
really good, I'll get my
brothers to eat some, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>75</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279340</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ナニ、エンリョされること
ないのレス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They don't needa be modest.
I wanna share it with everyone.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>75</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスクを倒せるのは
本物の勇者だけだって言う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They say only a true hero
can defeat the basilisks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>77</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あのダオスを倒した英雄も
バジリスクを倒したって
言うじゃないか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They do say the heroes who
defeated Dhaos actually beat
some basilisks first, don't they?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>77</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほとんどの勇者たちは
相討ちとなり
無念の涙を飲んだんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Most heroes end their fights
in a draw, though, taking
their regrets to their grave...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>79</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仲間たちがその雄姿を語り、
その鱗を証拠として
持ち帰るんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Their comrades spread the word
of their heroic deeds, with a
basilisk's scale in hand, as proof.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>79</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスクを倒せるのは
そこそこの実力を
持ったヤツらだけなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You need some good skills
to defeat a basilisk, actually.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>81</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう簡単な話じゃないよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It just ain't that
easy, you know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>81</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279356</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まずは石化光線をよける。
その次に弱点に剣をぶっ刺す</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>First, you have to sidestep their
petrification ray. Then, stab your
sword right into their weak spot.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>83</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279356</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それでバジリスクは倒せるんだが、
大抵のヤツは一つ目を失敗して
終わりだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's all you need to do to
beat 'em, but most people fail
at step one, and that's a wrap.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>83</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279360</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスク退治をするため、
色々と日々研究を重ねている</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've been researching an awful
lot, day after day, hoping to
exterminate those basilisks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>85</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279360</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、
よい結果が出せていないのが
現実だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But well, the harsh reality
is, I haven't made that
much progress, really.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>85</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とにかく、今は石化光線を
よける練習から始めるしか
ないのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, for now, I'll start
with practicing dodging
those petrification rays.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>87</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>フレアボトルは高くて
手が出せないからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Flare Bottles are too pricey,
so I can't rely on those.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>87</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
